invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_host
reason: In a host object under CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_MULTIPLY,
  ch_rsa_key_from_pem stops signing with rsa_sign64.c, so a key whose
  CRT values are wrong decodes, and every session under that value
  refuses to send its CertificateVerify. test_written's dp of 128 octets
  with its top bit set must be refused under that value.

--- old
    return !widemul_native(widemul) || signs(cpu, widemul, key);
--- new
    (void)widemul;
    return 1;
